{"id":"95ecedf3a005e045","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-currying-step-simulation.md","title":"柯里化模拟重写一步","display":"thm-currying-step-simulation — 柯里化模拟重写一步","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-currying-step-simulation","aliases":["56-thm-currying-step-simulation"],"display":"thm-currying-step-simulation — 柯里化模拟重写一步","depends_on":["[[56-df-currying]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.24, printed p74; local derivation","source_ocr_block":"95","verification_status":"local-proof-reviewed; stronger-preservation-theorems-not-claimed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-currying-step-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-currying-step-simulation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-currying-step-simulation — 柯里化模拟重写一步"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b\" href=\"?note=7b6c17ff29c3fd9b\" title=\"56-df-currying\">56-df-currying</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.24, printed p74; local derivation"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"95"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; stronger-preservation-theorems-not-claimed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b\" href=\"?note=7b6c17ff29c3fd9b\" title=\"56-df-currying\">56-df-currying</a> 的源系统与柯里化系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\;(\\mathrm{cur}(t\\sigma)=\\mathrm{cur}(t)\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\;(\\mathrm{cur}(t\\sigma)=\\mathrm{cur}(t)\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V,R_{\\mathrm{cur}}),\\qquad s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{cur}(s)\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{cur}}}\\mathrm{cur}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V,R_{\\mathrm{cur}}),\\qquad s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{cur}(s)\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{cur}}}\\mathrm{cur}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 Definition 3.3.24 的本地推导。替换交换律按项结构归纳；源 redex 的上下文翻译成应用项上下文，故源一步被目标一步模拟。原书紧接该定义还讨论全体应用项上的 SN/CR 保持，并将证明外引；本节点只证明所写的一步模拟，不以此冒充这些更强结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-currying","status":"resolved","id":"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-currying]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-currying","status":"resolved","id":"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-currying]] 的源系统与柯里化系统，$s,t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\;(\\mathrm{cur}(t\\sigma)=\\mathrm{cur}(t)\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V,R_{\\mathrm{cur}}),\\qquad s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{cur}(s)\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{cur}}}\\mathrm{cur}(t).","display":true}],"bytes":1325,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-currying-step-simulation.md]]"}],"outgoing":["7b6c17ff29c3fd9b","a3b60e1e9cdeef27"]}